          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "6. Complete the following sequences: a. (– 40), (– 34), (– 28), (– 22), b. 3, 4, 2, 5, 1, 6, 0, 7, _ c. , 12, 6, 1, (– 3), (– 6),"
            }
